# Boot -> title -> map zoom-out loading -> free roam, then close the window the way its close button does (WM_CLOSE).
# For launcher/dev/exit_probe.py (the exit hang). If the close does not happen, the script ends and the dev pad quits the game (exit_probe.py marks the run).
wait 8s
mark title
press_until start left_title every=2s timeout=90s
mark map_zoom
wait_until roam 180s
mark free_roam
wait 5s
log exit: window close
mark end
close
wait 60s
